      },
      "text": "You cut out for a second.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:18.018000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:20.326000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Elena Petrova"
      },
      "text": "I think that's mostly right, but there's a nuance there.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:20.917000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:24.763000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "What about Acmeway?",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:25.572000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:26.726000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "They signed at twenty.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:27.784000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:29.322000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Acmeway keeps twenty for the pilot year.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:30.159000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:32.851000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Marcus Chen"
      },
      "text": "We honour it.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:33.595000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:34.749000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Elena Petrova"
      },
      "text": "Right, right.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:35.709000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:36.509000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Elena Petrova"
      },
      "text": "Keep going.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:37.655000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:38.455000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "Let's make sure sales and",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:39.015000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:40.938000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Rivera"
      },
      "text": "marketing hear this at the same time.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:41.186000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:43.878000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "That's fair.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:44.691000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:45.491000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "I hadn't thought about um, it that way.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:46.416000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:49.493000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "I'm worried about I mean, how this lands with existing customers.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:49.799000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:54.029000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "I'd rather make a call call today than drag it out.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:54.269000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:58.500000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, that makes sense to me.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:07:58.997000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:08:01.304000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, I agree with um, that.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:08:01.694000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:08:04.001000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Marcus Chen"
      },
      "text": "Cool, I'll let you all go.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:08:05.128000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:08:07.435000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Marcus Chen"
      },
      "text": "like, Thanks.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-29T13:08:08.342000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-29T13:08:09.142000Z"
    }
  ]
}
